{"version":1,"content":"<p>雲浩影（Cloud）首次以師姐身分，帶領同門師弟藍奕持（Lester）參與「寰亞音樂」School Tour，走訪港九新界多間學校，透過音樂及遊戲與學生交流。</p><p>陳健安亦加入其中一站，除了獻唱及與學生互動，更分享由校園歌唱比賽起步的經歷，勉勵學生及早追尋所愛，並為即將應考文憑試的中六學生打氣。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:04:32.723816+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:26:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.892705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.276294+00:00","content_hash":"c165082480625caafd660d4880fee72340b8c13fd5c7bc95f6235f20d20e4bbe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}